WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.601 --> 00:00:02.734
-Right now guys, it is time
for "Tonight Show" hashtags.

00:00:02.734 --> 00:00:04.801
Here we go.
-♪ Hashtags ♪

00:00:07.100 --> 00:00:08.934
♪ Hashtags ♪

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:15.133
-Now, we do this thing every
week where I send out a hashtag

00:00:15.133 --> 00:00:17.000
and I ask you guys to respond to
that topic.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:21.133
So this week I sent out the
hashtag #AddAWordRuinAProduct.

00:00:21.133 --> 00:00:23.501
I asked you to take a product
and add one word

00:00:23.501 --> 00:00:24.834
to change the meaning.

00:00:24.834 --> 00:00:26.734
Within minutes, it was
a trending topic in the U.S.,

00:00:26.734 --> 00:00:28.400
so thank you for playing along.

00:00:28.400 --> 00:00:30.400
Now I thought I'd share
some of my favorite

00:00:30.400 --> 00:00:33.634
#AddAWordRuinAProduct tweets
from you guys.

00:00:33.634 --> 00:00:37.334
This first is from
@melissamuraco. She says...

00:00:39.467 --> 00:00:40.567
[ Laughter ]

00:00:40.567 --> 00:00:41.701
You see what it is?

00:00:43.434 --> 00:00:46.801
This one is from @christ0phrr.
He says...

00:00:48.534 --> 00:00:52.801
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:52.801 --> 00:00:54.868
Luckily it still doesn't
really work.

00:00:54.868 --> 00:00:56.100
-No.
-No.

00:00:56.100 --> 00:00:59.200
This one is from @jentusch.
She says...

00:01:01.367 --> 00:01:03.467
-Ooh.
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:03.467 --> 00:01:05.534
Honey nut sack Cheerios?

00:01:05.534 --> 00:01:07.701
[ Laughter ]

00:01:07.701 --> 00:01:09.868
Wait, what did you just say?
What was that?

00:01:09.868 --> 00:01:12.434
-I didn't just say it.
-What did she say?

00:01:12.434 --> 00:01:13.467
-Nuttin', honey.

00:01:13.467 --> 00:01:15.934
[ Laughter ]

00:01:15.934 --> 00:01:18.601
This one -- This one is
from @danimal --

00:01:18.601 --> 00:01:21.033
-Ooh!

00:01:21.033 --> 00:01:24.701
