00:01:26.734 --> 00:01:29.834
No. This is my man, Danimal.

00:01:32.434 --> 00:01:34.734
Oh, this is interesting.
-Oh, is it a good one?

00:01:34.734 --> 00:01:36.167
-Yeah.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:36.167 --> 00:01:38.701
You know insoles,
