00:01:48.634 --> 00:01:50.667
That hurts. Ow!

00:01:50.667 --> 00:01:52.634
-Dan!
-Ow!

00:01:52.634 --> 00:01:55.234
Danimal, don't hurt him!
-Danimal!

00:01:55.234 --> 00:01:56.601
-Please, Danimal,
don't hurt him.

00:01:56.601 --> 00:01:58.968
-[ Coughing ]

00:01:58.968 --> 00:02:02.000
-Do you have a loose cough?
-Yeah. Loose cough!

00:02:02.000 --> 00:02:05.734
-Okay. This one here is
from @cheytattoos. She says...

00:02:07.534 --> 00:02:09.901
